4
00:02:01.330 --> 00:02:03.330
Sissy.

5
00:02:05.450 --> 00:02:08.810
You're gonna go deaf!

6
00:02:41.130 --> 00:02:43.130
An autograph?

7
00:02:43.660 --> 00:02:46.220
I just thought that...
- Are you kidding me?

8
00:02:54.030 --> 00:02:56.030
Ma'am?

9
00:02:58.130 --> 00:03:00.130
Sheriff?
