Trevor. what were you thinking?
- You asked me that. and I'll tell you again. I wasn't thinking.

192
00:29:29.020 --> 00:29:30.890
That's your problem. you don't think!

193
00:29:30.890 --> 00:29:33.240
You want to be treated like an adult.
but you don't act like one.

194
