196
00:29:38.190 --> 00:29:40.950
Go to your room. Trevor! I don't want to see you again until dinner!

197
00:29:41.290 --> 00:29:43.490
Whoa! Hey. hey. hey! What happened?
- Mom's overreacting.

198
00:29:43.570 --> 00:29:45.650
Your son is acting out again.
- What did he do?

199
00:29:45.730 --> 00:29:49.160
So. you're already mad and taking her side?
- What did you do?

200
00:29:49.470 --> 00:29:53.240
I drew a picture.
